url: "https://github.com/InnovationLine/CasPINS"
abstract: |
  CasPINS (Cas-Primer-Indel Suite) is a comprehensive, open-source platform 
  for genome editing experiment design and analysis. It integrates three 
  essential modules: (1) gRNA/TALEN design with multi-species support and 
  efficiency scoring algorithms, (2) primer design for PCR and sequencing 
  validation, and (3) indel analysis using trace decomposition from Sanger 
  sequencing data. The suite provides both a graphical user interface (GUI) 
  built with Streamlit and command-line tools, making it accessible to 
  researchers with varying computational expertise.
